<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#diagonallyAdjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates corner and diagonal adjacency between dimension instances in memes"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#causallyRelatedTo> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#relationIndex> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
