<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#GradientIntegrated> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One dimension is consonant in gradient change to another, e.g. Text spacing and rhythm matching visual patterns and compositional flow in memes; or color-palette being gradient consonant to textual material elements."@en .
