<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01526#mapping_001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'put the money in a bag. now! that will be $0.15' is an instruction directed at the cashier, who is visually depicted as the person performing the action. The mapping is between the textual instruction and the visual entity (the cashier) who is the subject of the instruction. The cashier's cheerful demeanor contrasts with the absurdity of the instruction, enhancing the humor."@en .
