<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01526#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The user is projected onto the cashier (the smiling woman in the apron) as the entity being addressed by the text instruction 'put the money in a bag. now! that will be $0.15'. The text is directed at the cashier, who is visually depicted as the one performing the action, creating a direct projection of the user onto this visual entity. The humor arises from the user imagining themselves in the role of the cashier being instructed to perform an absurd task."@en .
